      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/adam/{size}/1946_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-11T12:59:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It’s something we’re considering working on, though right now we’re debating whether shorter webcomic-style stories or full-length comics would be a better move. On the scripting note, we have very talented writers. I always enjoy putting them through their paces, and would love to have the existing flavor text in there. Keep an eye out for updates!</p>",
